X-SOURCE:Meetup: Yoga In Nature NC
UID:event_315060985@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260610T042230Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260627T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260627T100000
SUMMARY:Yoga In Nature™\, ALL LEVELS\, Lake Crabtree Community Park
DESCRIPTION:Yoga In Nature™\, NC\nCome enjoy nature\, as we do an **ALL 
 LEVELS** vinyasa flow to yin yoga practice\, at this beautiful location\, 
 facing the lake. Modifications provided. Beginners welcome.\n\nBRING YOUR 
 OWN YOGA MAT\, towel\, water bottle\, and block (if you use one)\, sunscre
 en\, insect repellent. You may also want to bring an old towel or liner fo
 r under your mat\, if the ground is wet. We will meet in the open field ar
 ea near the parking lot. $15/person Accepting Venmo @Darlene-Genander or P
 ayPal dgenander@yogainnature.com or cash\n\nLake Crabtree County Park\, pa
 st the entrance booth\, at the open field\, near volleyball courts and Old
  Beech Nature Trail... first right after you enter the park.(If you get to
  the entrance where there are boat rentals and launch area you've gone too
  far).\nLake Crabtree County Park\, 1400 Aviation Parkway\, Morrisville
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/yogainnaturenc/events/315060985/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260601T213605Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260601T213605Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Yoga In Nature NC
UID:event_315061230@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260610T042230Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260627T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260627T130000
SUMMARY:Yoga in Nature™\, SUP YOGA\, Lake Crabtree Community Park
DESCRIPTION:Yoga In Nature™\, NC\n**THIS IS CROSS-POSTED WITH YOGA IN NA
 TURE™ SUP YOGA GROUP.**\n**SUP (Standup Paddle Board) YOGA!!!!** **$40 d
 ue at sign-up to hold your spot. ONLY 7 SPOTS AVAILABLE.**\n**Venmo @Darle
 ne-Genander OR PayPal dgenander@yogainnature.com OR Zelle**\n\nCome join t
 he fun!!! As a certified SUP Yoga Instructor\, I will teach you the basics
  and more advanced options (if you have already been doing SUP Yoga)\, so 
 you gain the confidence you need on your board.\nYou will need to bring or
  own board AND paddle for this class. I have anchors which you may borrow 
 for the yoga portion of the class. I have one board for rent on a first re
 quest basis for $25. There may be some paddle boards to rent at this locat
 ion\, but inquire in advance: For more information on Boat Rentals\, call 
 [919-460-3398](http://tel:_19194603398/) or see the [Boat Rental Informati
 on](http://%5Bhttps//s3.us-west-1.amazonaws.com/wakegov.com.if-us-west-1/s
 3fs-public/documents/2025-03/2025%20BR%20Info.docx%5D(https://s3.us-west-1
 .amazonaws.com/wakegov.com.if-us-west-1/s3fs-public/documents/2025-03/2025
 %20BR%20Info.docx)) flyer.\nI will have free Good Pop popsicles following 
 our on-water yoga flow/SUP Yoga on the water. Fun in the sun!!!\n$40/perso
 n\nSUP Yoga will be at the beach area but park at 2nd parking lot/ 3rd rig
 ht hand turn off of Lake Crabtree Park Rd (if this is full\, park by the w
 hite lookout tower/bathrooms). We will launch at the kayak/ SUP rental loc
 ation (down the path)/ near the white lookout tower. We will have some bas
 ic on-land instruction for about 10 minutes then paddle out and anchor (th
 ose with experience can paddle out earlier). We will then have a mostly be
 ginner yoga class (modifications for more advanced students) which will be
  about 60 minutes for a mostly grounded flow (some standing asanas). We wi
 ll then paddle back in. MUST HAVE YOUR OWN BOARD OR RENT/BORROW ONE FOR TH
 IS CLASS. I have one board to rent for $25 and I have anchors for anyone t
 hat needs one. Message me for details.\nLake Crabtree County Park\, past t
 he entrance booth\, 3rd right hand turn to parking lot.\nLake Crabtree Cou
 nty Park\, 1400 Aviation Parkway\, Morrisville
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/yogainnaturenc/events/315061230/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260601T214814Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260601T214814Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Yoga In Nature NC
UID:event_315138512@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260610T042230Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260704T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260704T100000
SUMMARY:Yoga In Nature™\, ALL LEVELS FREEDOM FLOW\, NCMA
DESCRIPTION:Yoga In Nature™\, NC\n**ALL LEVELS. FREEDOM FLOW IS BACK**. 
 Join us for a **JULY 4th vinyasa flow to yin** practice ending in savasana
 . Join our community and meet other like-minded people! This yoga flow is 
 about *finding freedom in our bodies and our minds to flow more freely in 
 our yoga practice and in life*.\n\nPractice vinyasa flow yoga at North Car
 olina Museum of Art\, outdoors near upper parking area in grass ellipse...
  (NOTE THIS GRASS LOCATION\, as there are other groups that use NCMA groun
 ds). WHEN YOU COME INTO THE PARKING LOT\, DRIVE TO WHERE THE TWO PARKING L
 OTS ON BLUE RIDGE MEET\, AWAY FROM THE MUSEUM. We practice in the grass El
 lipse area:)\n$15/person\nCash\nVenmo @Darlene-Genander (0862)\nPaypal dge
 nander@yogainnature.com\n\nCome flow with us. We will begin in a seated me
 ditation\, then vinyasa flow practice to yin\, ending in savasana. Meet ot
 hers\, make friends in our yoga community as we flow with freedom in our m
 inds\, bodies and hearts!\nALL LEVELS WELCOME.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/yogainnaturenc/events/315138512/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260606T223237Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260606T223237Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
